# Every text file is checked out with LF line endings, on every platform.
#
# The build is byte-sensitive: the curapackage is compared file for file
# against the source tree, and qmlformat reads a carriage return as file
# CONTENT rather than as a line ending. A Windows checkout with
# core.autocrlf=true therefore produced a working tree whose every QML
# file failed the format gate and whose package bytes differed from the
# ones CI builds. Pinning the endings here fixes it for every clone
# instead of relying on each machine's git config.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Assets that must never be normalised.
*.png binary
*.stl binary
*.npz binary
*.ico binary
